# the_agents_own_kinds_cross_and_nothing_else
#
# WHAT CROSSES IS WHAT A RULE MAY READ, and the fill ASKS which graphs those are. Every PUBLIC
# graph crosses — asked of the catalogue, never listed — and so does the catalogue itself,
# since every read inside asks it what the graphs are. Of the agent's OWN, the kinds a search
# reads cross: its readings, its predictions, its picks, its desires and its wants. `:sensed`
# is a `orexis:StateGraph` and crosses for that reason.
#
# AND A KIND NOBODY ASKS FOR STAYS BEHIND. `:scratch` is the agent's and is classified nothing
# a rule reads, so it does not cross — which is what makes "asked" mean something.
#
# IT WAS TWO CASES AND A PARAMETER. The caller used to LIST which of its own graphs crossed,
# so one case passed `:sensed` and one did not, and the two files were otherwise identical.
# Which graphs are the agent's own is a question the store answers; a list the caller keeps is
# a second place the answer lives, and the day the two disagreed nothing would have said so.
#
# The clock stands at 2026-01-01T12:00:00Z, which is where the ground is laid from.

@prefix : <http://example.org/test#> .
@prefix orexis: <http://example.org/orexis#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix planning: <http://example.org/orexis/planning#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix ground: <http://example.org/orexis/graph/ground/1/> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

GRAPH :world {
  :tank1 a :Tank .
}

GRAPH :sensed {
  :tank1 :level 5 .
}

GRAPH :scratch {
  :note :says "a working graph of no kind the search asks for" .
}

GRAPH :catalogue {
  :scratch a orexis:Graph .
  :scratch orexis:beliefsOf :keeper .
  :catalogue a orexis:CatalogueGraph .
  :catalogue a orexis:Graph .
  :ontology a orexis:Graph .
  :ontology a orexis:OntologyGraph .
  :ontology a orexis:PublicGraph .
  :sensed a orexis:BeliefGraph .
  :sensed a orexis:Graph .
  :sensed a orexis:StateGraph .
  :sensed orexis:beliefsOf :keeper .
  :world a orexis:Graph .
  :world a orexis:PublicGraph .
}
